  <!--
    Spoken key names (KeyChordFormat, installed by ShellBootstrap). Chinese
    keyboards are labelled in English and RimWorld's own zh-Hans corpus writes
    Shift, Esc, Home and Page Up in English, so those key names keep the Latin
    form the player reads on the keycap. Only the keys with an established
    Chinese spoken name (arrows, Enter, Space, the punctuation keys and the
    numeric keypad) are worded in Chinese. {0} in NumpadDigit is the digit 0 to 9.
  -->
